see "../src/rng.vox".
see "../src/gen_literals.vox".
see "../src/gen_manifest.vox".
see "../src/gen_core.vox".
see "../src/gen_keywords.vox".
see "../src/gen_expressions.vox".
see "../src/gen_buffers.vox".
see "../src/gen_files.vox".
see "../src/gen_collections.vox".
see "../src/gen_text.vox".
see "../src/gen_things.vox".
see "../src/gen_flow.vox".
see "../src/gen_misc.vox".
see "../src/gen_process.vox".
see "../src/gen_basics.vox".

(basics leaves, batch A - docs/ledger/basics.md rows BAS-07, 09, 10, 11,
 12, 13, 14, 16, 17, 24, 41, 43, 46. Kinds 310-319.

 Each leaf is called directly off a pinned rng seed and its emitted
 source printed in full, so the golden is the generated Vox itself, the
 same convention tests/300_gen_buffers_a.vox and tests/450_gen_process_a.vox
 use. Every leaf here is top-level-only (the reserved span is drawn only
 at depth 3 in 'gen statement'), so each is driven with indent "" and
 nested false only - there is no nested rendering to check.)

Print "--- BAS-07, 09, 10: comment placement, standalone position ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment placement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a seed that draws the trailing position ---".
'rng seed' of 2.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment placement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-11: comment mid-declaration ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment mid statement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, mid-expression ---".
'rng seed' of 8.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment mid statement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, mid-condition ---".
'rng seed' of 95.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment mid statement' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-12, 13: comment spanning lines and nested parens ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment multiline nested' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-14: parens inside a string literal ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment lookalike in string' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-24: comment-only line does not close ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf comment only line does not close' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-16: blank line count invariant ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf blank line count invariant' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-17: blank line closes a nested loop, Repeat ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf blank line closes nested loop' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a seed that draws For each ---".
'rng seed' of 3.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf blank line closes nested loop' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- the same leaf, a seed that draws While ---".
'rng seed' of 5.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf blank line closes nested loop' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-41: blank line closes a loop and its enclosing function ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf blank line closes function too' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-43: blank line closes an On error block ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf blank line closes on error' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- BAS-46: blank line after a comma is cosmetic ---".
'rng seed' of 1.
'gen buffer names reset'.
clear gen_out.
'gen leaf blank line after comma is cosmetic' of "" and false.
Print 'gen text'.

Print "--- registration reachable: kinds 310-319 all dispatch without error ---".
a number called 'the kind' is 310.
While 'the kind' is less than 320,
    clear gen_out,
    'gen dispatch leaf' of 'the kind' and "" and false,
    Print "kind {'the kind'}: {gen_out's length} bytes emitted",
    Set 'the kind' to 'the kind' add 1.
